---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';

const baseUrl = import.meta.env.BASE_URL.replace(/\/$/, '');
---

<BaseLayout
  title="BarePDF Manifesto — An Architectural Refusal"
  description="A statement by Efe Arabacı on local document ownership, bounded memory, and software that stays out of the way."
  currentPath={`${baseUrl}/manifesto`}
  ogImage={`${baseUrl}/images/manifesto-cover.png`}
>
  <article class="manifesto-shell">
    <div class="manifesto-container">
      <section class="manifesto-hero" aria-labelledby="manifesto-title">
        <div class="manifesto-hero-copy">
          <p class="manifesto-kicker" data-i18n data-en="A STATEMENT BY EFE ARABACI" data-tr="EFE ARABACI'NIN AÇIKLAMASI">A STATEMENT BY EFE ARABACI</p>
          <h1 id="manifesto-title" data-i18n
            data-en="BarePDF exists for people who only want to open a document and read it."
            data-tr="BarePDF, yalnızca bir belgeyi açıp okumak isteyenler için geliştirildi.">
            BarePDF exists for people who only want to open a document and read it.
          </h1>
          <p class="manifesto-lead" data-i18n
            data-en="A local file is not a pretext for a platform. Opening a PDF on your own machine should not require an account, an active connection, background telemetry, or an interface competing for your attention."
            data-tr="Yerel bir dosya, bir platformun bahanesi değildir. Kendi bilgisayarınızda bir PDF açmak için hesap açmanız, internete bağlanmanız, arka plan telemetrisine katlanmanız veya dikkatinizi bölen arayüzlerle uğraşmanız gerekmemelidir.">
            A local file is not a pretext for a platform. Opening a PDF on your own machine should not require an account, an active connection, background telemetry, or an interface competing for your attention.
          </p>
          <a class="manifesto-link" href="#the-refusal">
            <span data-i18n data-en="Read the architectural refusal" data-tr="Mimari ret metnini oku">Read the architectural refusal</span> ↓
          </a>
        </div>

        <figure class="manifesto-art">
          <img src={`${baseUrl}/images/manifesto-cover.png`} alt="Geometric architectural illustration representing isolated local document reading and bounded scope." width="1024" height="1536" />
        </figure>
      </section>

      <div class="manifesto-rule" aria-hidden="true"></div>

      <section class="manifesto-grid" id="the-refusal">
        <div class="manifesto-prose">
          <p class="manifesto-index" data-i18n data-en="01 / THE RENTED FILE" data-tr="01 / KİRALANAN DOSYA">01 / THE RENTED FILE</p>
          <h2 data-i18n data-en="Local files should not pass through someone else's gate." data-tr="Yerel dosyalar başkasının kapısından geçmemelidir.">
            Local files should not pass through someone else's gate.
          </h2>
          <p data-i18n
            data-en="Too many desktop PDF tools now behave like client terminals for subscription platforms. They initialize analytics SDKs on startup, prompt for logins before displaying files already sitting on your disk, and treat every opened page as a telemetry event or an upsell opportunity."
            data-tr="Günümüzde pek çok masaüstü PDF yazılımı, abonelik platformlarının birer istemcisi gibi davranıyor. Açılışta analitik SDK'larını başlatıyor, diskinizdeki dosyayı göstermeden önce oturum açmanızı istiyor ve açılan her sayfayı bir telemetri olayına ya da satış fırsatına dönüştürüyor.">
            Too many desktop PDF tools now behave like client terminals for subscription platforms. They initialize analytics SDKs on startup, prompt for logins before displaying files already sitting on your disk, and treat every opened page as a telemetry event or an upsell opportunity.
          </p>

          <p class="manifesto-index" data-i18n data-en="02 / BOUNDED BY DESIGN" data-tr="02 / TASARIMLA ÖLÇÜLÜ">02 / BOUNDED BY DESIGN</p>
          <h2 data-i18n data-en="A silent reader is an explicit engineering contract." data-tr="Sessiz bir okuyucu, açık bir mühendislik sözleşmesidir.">
            A silent reader is an explicit engineering contract.
          </h2>
          <p data-i18n
            data-en="BarePDF executes every operation—PDFium rasterization, glyph highlights, vector ink, page merging, splitting, cropping, and compression—strictly inside your local process. Memory stays constrained under explicit byte-budgeted LRU caches, obsolete scroll work cancels immediately, and network sockets remain silent unless you turn on Ed25519-verified update checks."
            data-tr="BarePDF tüm işlemleri—PDFium görüntüleme, metin vurgulama, vektörel çizim, sayfa birleştirme, bölme, kırpma ve sıkıştırmayı—yalnızca yerel işlemcinizde yürütür. Bellek kullanımı açık byte bütçeli LRU önbellekleriyle sınırlandırılır, eski kaydırma işleri anında iptal edilir ve siz Ed25519 imzalı güncelleme denetimini açmadıkça hiçbir ağ isteği yapılmaz.">
            BarePDF executes every operation—PDFium rasterization, glyph highlights, vector ink, page merging, splitting, cropping, and compression—strictly inside your local process. Memory stays constrained under explicit byte-budgeted LRU caches, obsolete scroll work cancels immediately, and network sockets remain silent unless you turn on Ed25519-verified update checks.
          </p>

          <p class="manifesto-index" data-i18n data-en="03 / GENUINE OWNERSHIP" data-tr="03 / GERÇEK MÜLKİYET">03 / GENUINE OWNERSHIP</p>
          <h2 data-i18n data-en="Leave room for the document and the machine." data-tr="Belgeye ve makineye yer bırak.">
            Leave room for the document and the machine.
          </h2>
          <p data-i18n
            data-en="Software earns trust by staying bounded in scope, footprint, and behavior. BarePDF does not ask for an account, inject promotional panels, or consume gigabytes of RAM to display a two-page report. It leaves the screen to the document, the hardware to your work, and the file under your control."
            data-tr="Bir yazılım güveni kapsamını, kaynak tüketimini ve davranışını net tutarak kazanır. BarePDF sizden hesap istemez, tanıtım panelleri yerleştirmez ve iki sayfalık bir raporu göstermek için gigabaytlarca RAM tüketmez. Ekranı belgeye, donanımı işinize ve dosyayı tamamen sizin denetiminize bırakır.">
            Software earns trust by staying bounded in scope, footprint, and behavior. BarePDF does not ask for an account, inject promotional panels, or consume gigabytes of RAM to display a two-page report. It leaves the screen to the document, the hardware to your work, and the file under your control.
          </p>
        </div>

        <aside class="manifesto-aside" aria-label="Manifesto summary">
          <div class="manifesto-stamp">
            <span>BAREPDF</span>
            <span data-i18n data-en="OFFLINE BY DEFAULT" data-tr="VARSAYILAN ÇEVRİMDIŞI">OFFLINE BY DEFAULT</span>
          </div>
          <blockquote data-i18n
            data-en="“You are not a user funnel. You are the person who opened a file on your own machine. That is enough.”"
            data-tr="“Siz bir dönüşüm hunisi değilsiniz. Kendi makinenizde bir dosya açan insansınız. Bu yeterlidir.”">
            “You are not a user funnel. You are the person who opened a file on your own machine. That is enough.”
          </blockquote>
          <p class="manifesto-signature">Efe Arabacı</p>
        </aside>
      </section>
    </div>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .manifesto-shell {
    --manifesto-bg: #0f1012;
    --manifesto-surface: #16171a;
    --manifesto-text: #f3f4f6;
    --manifesto-muted: #a3a6b2;
    --manifesto-accent: #f2861c;
    background: var(--manifesto-bg);
    color: var(--manifesto-text);
    min-height: calc(100vh - 72px);
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  .manifesto-container {
    width: min(1160px, 100% - 3rem);
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: clamp(3.5rem, 6vw, 6.5rem) 0;
  }

  .manifesto-hero {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1.1fr) minmax(280px, 0.9fr);
    align-items: center;
    gap: clamp(2.5rem, 6vw, 6rem);
  }

  .manifesto-hero-copy {
    max-width: 640px;
  }

  .manifesto-kicker,
  .manifesto-index {
    color: var(--manifesto-accent);
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.12em;
    line-height: 1.4;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }

  .manifesto-hero h1 {
    color: var(--manifesto-text);
    font-size: clamp(2.4rem, 5vw, 4.2rem);
    font-weight: 800;
    letter-spacing: -0.04em;
    line-height: 1.05;
    margin-bottom: 1.75rem;
  }

  .manifesto-lead {
    color: var(--manifesto-muted);
    font-size: clamp(1.05rem, 1.5vw, 1.25rem);
    line-height: 1.6;
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
  }

  .manifesto-link {
    align-items: center;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--manifesto-accent);
    color: var(--manifesto-text);
    display: inline-flex;
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    gap: 0.5rem;
    padding-bottom: 0.35rem;
  }

  .manifesto-link:hover {
    color: var(--manifesto-accent);
    text-decoration: none;
  }

  .manifesto-art {
    margin: 0;
    max-width: 420px;
    justify-self: end;
    border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
    overflow: hidden;
    border: 1px solid #2e3037;
  }

  .manifesto-art img {
    aspect-ratio: 2 / 3;
    display: block;
    object-fit: cover;
    width: 100%;
  }

  .manifesto-rule {
    background: var(--manifesto-accent);
    height: 1px;
    margin: clamp(4rem, 8vw, 6rem) 0 clamp(2.5rem, 5vw, 4.5rem);
    opacity: 0.4;
    width: 100%;
  }

  .manifesto-grid {
    display: grid;
    gap: clamp(2.5rem, 6vw, 6rem);
    grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1.35fr) minmax(240px, 0.65fr);
  }

  .manifesto-prose {
    max-width: 680px;
  }

  .manifesto-prose .manifesto-index:not(:first-child) {
    margin-top: 3.5rem;
  }

  .manifesto-prose h2 {
    color: var(--manifesto-text);
    font-size: clamp(1.6rem, 2.5vw, 2.2rem);
    letter-spacing: -0.03em;
    line-height: 1.15;
    margin: 0 0 1rem;
  }

  .manifesto-prose p:not(.manifesto-index) {
    color: var(--manifesto-muted);
    font-size: 1.05rem;
    line-height: 1.75;
    margin: 0;
  }

  .manifesto-aside {
    align-self: start;
    background: var(--manifesto-surface);
    border: 1px solid #2e3037;
    border-left: 3px solid var(--manifesto-accent);
    border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
    padding: 2rem;
    position: sticky;
    top: 7rem;
  }

  .manifesto-stamp {
    color: var(--manifesto-accent);
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.72rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    line-height: 1.4;
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
  }

  .manifesto-stamp span {
    display: block;
  }

  .manifesto-aside blockquote {
    color: var(--manifesto-text);
    font-size: clamp(1.25rem, 2vw, 1.75rem);
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: -0.03em;
    line-height: 1.25;
    margin: 0 0 1.5rem;
  }

  .manifesto-signature {
    color: var(--manifesto-muted);
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    margin: 0;
  }

  @media (max-width: 800px) {
    .manifesto-hero,
    .manifesto-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }

    .manifesto-art {
      justify-self: start;
      max-width: 360px;
    }

    .manifesto-aside {
      position: static;
    }
  }
</style>
